{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ghiLi36W995neZl2EnSmEw","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:20.337308+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ghiLi36W995neZl2EnSmEw","html":"<div><section><section><section><p><span>      </span></p><p><span><span><span>为促进高校优秀大学生之间的交流，让有志读研的优秀本科生更好地了解</span></span><span><span>广东工业大学物理与光电工程学院</span></span><span><span>，吸引更多的优秀生源报读物理学院的硕士生，拟定于</span></span><span><span>202</span></span></span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>7月</span></span></span><span><span><span>7-8</span></span></span><span><span><span>日举办广东工业大学物理与光电工程学院优秀大学生夏令营活动。本次活动初定线下举行，具体安排另行通知。欢迎校内外本科生报名参加！</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>学院简介</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>物理与光电工程学院的前身是</span><span><span>2000年4月创建的应用物理系，2003年更名为应用物理学院，2005年再更名为物理与光电工程学院。2000年秋季开始电子科学与技术专业本科招生，2001年开始材料物理与化学硕士专业招生，2004年开始物理电子学专业硕士和光信息科学与技术专业本科招生，2012年自设材料物理与化学二级学科博士点，2013年光信息科学与技术专业更名为光电信息科学与工程专业，2020年开始电子信息类专业学位硕士招生。</span></span></p><p><span>物理与光电工程学院现位于广东工业大学大学城校区实验三、四号楼，下设电子科学与技术系、光电信息科学与工程系、大学物理部、实验中心、党政办公室。学院现有材料物理与化学二级学科博士点、电子科学与技术和光学工程一级学科硕士点、材料物理与化学二级学科硕士点，电子科学与技术、光电信息科学与工程</span><span><span><span>、应用物理学</span></span></span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span><span>个本科专业</span></span></span><span><span><span>，</span></span></span><span><span><span>2025年新增量子信息科学本科专业</span></span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span><span><span>“物理电子学”2007年被广东省列为省级重点扶持学科，“电子科学与技术”2012年被广东省列为省级重点学科—优势重点学科。学院是广东省物理学会的常务理事单位、光学学会的理事单位。自办学以来，学院为广东省经济建设和发展</span></span></span><span><span><span>培养了一批高素质的应用型人才。</span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>夏令营介绍</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>本次夏令营将邀请本领域的优秀专家学者做交流报告，</span></span><span><span><span><span>走访省级重点</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>实验室，与导师互动等</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>，作为学院对外宣传展示发展历程、学科建设、院系文化的重要方式途径，</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>热诚欢迎同学</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>们</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>前来参加本次夏令营活动。</span></span></span></span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>活动安排</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1.</span><strong><span><span>报名时间</span></span></strong><span>：</span><span><span>即日起至</span></span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span>30</span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>2.</span><strong><span><span>活动时间</span></span></strong><span>：</span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span><span>7月</span></span><span><span><span>7-8</span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>1.拥护中国共产党，热爱祖国，品德优良，遵纪守法，身心健康；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.诚实守信，学风端正，无任何考试作弊、剽窃他人学术成果以及其他违法违纪受处分记录；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>物理</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>学科</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>、电子学科、材料学科</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>及相关专业（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>材料物理与化学、</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>电子</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>科</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>学</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>与技术、</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>光学工程、</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>光电信息科学与工程</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>电子信息类</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>等</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）的全日制本科在校三年级学生</span></span></span><span><span>(即202</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>届毕业生</span></span></span><span><span>)；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>.学习成绩优秀</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>，</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>具有一定的学术科研能力或潜力，取得成果者优先；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>.具备良好的英文听说读写能力，通过全国大学英语</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>四级或</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>六级考试（成绩不低于</span></span></span><span><span>426分）或达到相关水平：CET</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span></span><span><span><span> or 6≥425 / TOEFL≥90 / IELTS≥6.0。</span></span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>报名方式与申请材料</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>接收人数</span></strong></p></section><section><p><span><span>我院本次夏令营拟接收</span></span><strong><span><span>30人</span></span></strong><span><span>左右。</span></span><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>报名及提交材料</span></strong></p></section><section><p><span><strong><span>步骤1</span></strong></span><span>：填写报名问卷</span></p></section><section><section><p><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/y3f7HtgOsRp6EHCQfU2FgMSaSM2eBSvSAibkFulhPHn02c1zrOfX0YGicFqqZFp3ahYDmbHcCEl8Ycs8DrnIshCw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><span>问卷网址链接：</span></span><span><span>https://www.wjx.top/vm/YUkt6OD.aspx</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>注意：请填写常用邮箱及联系电话。</span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><strong><span>步骤2</span></strong></span><span>：<span>提交电子版材料（请按照顺序提供）</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span>1）</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>广东工业大学物理与光电工程学院</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>优秀大学生夏令营申请表（附件</span></span></span><span><span>1）；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span>2）本科阶段成绩单原件和前两年半总评成绩排名证明原件（均须教务部门盖章）；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span>3）英语水平证明材料复印件（如全国大学生英语四/六级考试成绩、TOEFL成绩、GRE成绩、雅思成绩等）；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span>4）奖励及科研成果证明材料（如体现自身学术水平的代表性学术论文或其他原创性工作成果、获奖证书复印件等）；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span>5）学生证及身份证复印件各1份（学生证将个人信息页和注册信息页复印在1张A4纸上；身份证将正反面复印在1张A4纸上）。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>以上材料，请按顺序整合成一份</span></span></span><span><span>PDF文件，202</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>30</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span><span><span>12:00</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>前通过提交到问卷星上传，注意：一份</span></span></span><span><span>PDF不要超过10M。</span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><strong><span>步骤3</span></strong></span><span>：</span><span><span><span>提交纸质版材料公布夏令营入营名单后，获得入营资格的申请人在入营报道时需提交纸质版材料。报名者须对报名材料的真实性负责，若发现材料造假者，按有关规定处理。</span></span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>营员遴选结果通知</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>学院组织专家审核报名材料并确定入营名单，名单将在学院</span></span><span><span><span><span>官方</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>网站上公布。申请人应在指定的时间内确认是否参加，逾期视为放弃。</span></span></span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>主要活动安排</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><strong><span>7月6日</span></strong></span><span>：入营报到（线上）。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>7月7日</span></span></strong><span>：</span><span><span><span>上午开营典礼和主题讲座</span></span></span><span><span><span>，沙龙互动，</span></span></span><span><span><span>参观走访实验室</span></span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>7月8日</span></span></strong><span>：参观校园或返回。</span></p><p><span>注：本日程为拟定计划，具体时间安排公布入营名单时另行通知。</span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>活动补贴</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>夏令营采用线下形式进行，我院将为参营人员提供在营期间食宿费用（广州本地高校学生不提供住宿）及往返交通费用。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>其中，交通费用方面：</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>1.学员可预订汽车、火车、高铁、飞机等，最终按照高铁“二等座”或普通火车“硬座或硬卧”票标准报销，最高报销600元，其余差额自付；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.报销须有票根原件，交通票背面请注明自己的姓名，须本人票方可报销，往返站点限学校或家庭地址；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.学员返程票应于夏令营活动结束后两周内寄回学院，飞机票请保留登机牌和发票（即电子客票行程单），否则将无法报销；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.市内交通（仅限广州本地高校学生）请按照公共交通费，凭票报销（车票背面请注明自己的姓名，往返地点）。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>///////////</span></p></section></section><section><p><span><span>请报名的同学务必加入QQ群“2025年广工物理夏令营”（</span><span><strong><span>334056891</span></strong></span><span>）</span></span></p><p><span><span>咨询电话：</span><span><strong><span>020-39322266 </span></strong></span><span>米老师</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>咨询邮箱：</span></span><span><strong><span>mitingting@gdut.edu.cn</span></strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>附件</span></span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span>：广东工业大学物理与光电工程学院</span></span><span><span>202</span></span></span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span><span>年全国优秀大学生夏令营申请表</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>附件</span></span></span><span><span><span>2：广东工业大学物理与光电工程学院夏令营安全知情同意书</span></span><span><br/></span></span></p><section><span><span>附件下载，点击学院网站</span></span></section><p><span><strong><span>https://wlgdxy.gdut.edu.cn/info/1033/4443.htm</span></strong></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>END</span><span><br/></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section><section><section></section><section></section><section></section></section></section><section><p><span>物理与光电工程学院</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>图文编辑：物理与光电工程学院全媒体中心</span></span></p><p><span><span>初审：罗望超</span></span></p><p><span><span>复审：陈萍丽</span></span></p><p><span><span>终审：蓝锐彬</span></span></p></section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/y3f7HtgOsRrXEaeOs4nYicW9NhhadNd9osUq5SIJ3Z5cEDT9mN5xwQuLwYicFzxYuNbJBqhB4KYCtgEplISbxjCw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;tp=wxpic&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1\"/></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"965edf58cb9e0ff3c199f3ef592a8fc1200e61995fd1c1ec060f12f4b41d40bd","textLength":2285,"sourceSha256":"0d4369667e7dd43530080692c7af7c708fb3b6f28b5d8ab0f6045247f2f8a996","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-e9be63a8d4f18a13c089","title":"2025年广东工业大学物理与光电工程学院2025年全国优秀大学生夏令营活动通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:20.337308+00:00"}
